k:meeting%20this%20week;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:1;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;meeting this week&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">meeting this week</a>.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->(<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BZ=F/\" data-ylk=\"slk:BZ%3DF;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:2;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;BZ=F&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">BZ=F</a>) crude rose to $109 per barrel, stoking worries of persistent inflation as diesel prices remain above an all-time high <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/us-diesel-prices-cross-6-per-gallon-setting-new-record-122447671.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:of%20%246%20per%20gallon.;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:3;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;of $6 per gallon.&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;3&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">of $6 per gallon.</a><!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Bond yields remained elevated, with the 10-year Treasury (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5ETNX/\" data-ylk=\"slk:%5ETNX;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:4;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;^TNX&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;4&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">^TNX</a>) just a few basis points away from <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/10-year-treasury-yield-rises-as-oil-prices-jump-123457398.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:the%205%25%20threshold.;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:5;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;the 5% threshold.&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;5&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">the 5% threshold.</a><!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>                <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->The 2-year yield to 4.64%, signaling that markets <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/article/fed-rate-hike-odds-surge-to-90-on-monthly-jump-in-core-prices-131206510.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:expect%20Fed%20policymakers%20to%20raise%20rates.;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:6;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;expect Fed policymakers to raise rates.&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;6&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">expect Fed policymakers to raise rates.</a> Investor bets that the Federal Reserve will hike rates on Wednesday <a href=\"https://polymarket.com/event/fed-decision-in-september-762\" data-ylk=\"slk:stood%20at%2080%25%20on%20Polymarket.%20;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:7;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;stood at 80% on Polymarket. &quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;7&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">stood at 80% on Polymarket.</a><!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Here's a check of the markets in the first few minutes of trading, based on a heat map powered by <a href=\"https://alphaspace.finance.yahoo.com/\" data-ylk=\"slk:Yahoo%20Finance%20AlphaSpace%20data;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:8;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;Yahoo Finance AlphaSpace data&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;8&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">Yahoo Finance AlphaSpace data</a>.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>   <figure data-testid=\"article-figure-image\"><div> <p><a href=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/382b4fca026209b8aa75e6c1619d251e3f6a6385a1aaced041bdc0e50f40aaad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-09-14-at-93634-am_0462.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==\" alt=\"Tech stocks took a leg down on Monday after agreement from AI's leaders over the need to slow development.\" height=\"522\" width=\"960\"></a></p></div> <figcaption><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Tech stocks took a leg down on Monday after agreement from AI's leaders over the need to slow development.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  <span data-svelte-h=\"svelte-nxhdlu\">·</span> <span>Yahoo Finance AlphaSpace</span></figcaption> </figure>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Tech stocks <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/XLK\" data-ylk=\"slk:(XLK;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:9;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;(XLK&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;9&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">(XLK</a>) declined more than 2% as chip heavyweight (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA/\" data-ylk=\"slk:NVDA;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:10;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;NVDA&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;10&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">NVDA</a>) led the semiconductor complex lower.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->The move comes after AI titans at Anthropic (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ANTH.PVT/\" data-ylk=\"slk:ANTH.PVT;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:11;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;ANTH.PVT&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;11&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">ANTH.PVT</a>) and OpenAI (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT/\" data-ylk=\"slk:OPAI.PVT;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:12;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;OPAI.PVT&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;12&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">OPAI.PVT</a>) have <a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/article/openai-ceo-sam-altman-on-ai-we-could-lose-control-091146594.html\" data-ylk=\"slk:sounded%20the%20alarm;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:13;pos:1;_E:mb_qualified_link;ct:story;outcm:mb_qualified_link;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;sounded the alarm&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&quot;,&quot;yLinkPosition&quot;:&quot;13&quot;,&quot;yPosition&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;yContentType&quot;:&quot;story&quot;,&quot;yTrafficOrigin&quot;:&quot;content-canvas default&quot;}\" target=\"_blank\">sounded the alarm</a> on the risks to humanity of artificial intelligence.<!-- HTML_TAG_END -->  </p>        <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START --><strong>Here are some other notable stocks that Yahoo Finance readers are viewing this morning:&#160;</strong>AMD (<a href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD\" data-ylk=\"slk:AMD;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;cpos:14;pos:1;source:content-canvas%20default\" data-yga=\"{&quot;yLinkText&quot;:&quot;AMD&quot;,&quot;yLinkElement&quot;:&quot;context_link&quot;,&quot;yModuleName&quot;:&quot;content-canvas&q