ality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fo.aolcdn.com%2Fimages%2Fdims%3Fimage_uri%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fs.yimg.com%252Fos%252Fcreatr-uploaded-images%252F2019-06%252F97285f00-895d-11e9-9b7a-2b53cff69736%26compress%3D1%26progressive%3D1%26quality%3D75%26client%3Dhawkeye%26signature%3D9c0d71acf684c03ee294d31b319e6ee0f5427b68\" alt=\"Ines Ferré\" loading=\"eager\">  </a></p> <div> <p>Mon, September 14, 2026 at 9:45 AM EDT 1 min read</p></div></div>   <div data-testid=\"article-body\">        <p>早上好。 Stocks fell on Monday as oil prices jumped ahead of a key Fed meeting this week.</p>        <p>(BZ=F) crude rose to $109 per barrel, stoking worries of persistent inflation as diesel prices remain above an all-time high of $6 per gallon.</p>        <p>Bond yields remained elevated, with the 10-year Treasury (^TNX) just a few basis points away from the 5% threshold.</p>                <p>The 2-year yield to 4.64%, signaling that markets expect Fed policymakers to raise rates. Investor bets that the Federal Reserve will hike rates on Wednesday stood at 80% on Polymarket.</p>        <p>Here's a check of the markets in the first few minutes of trading, based on a heat map powered by Yahoo Finance AlphaSpace data.</p>   <figure data-testid=\"article-figure-image\"><div> <p><a href=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/382b4fca026209b8aa75e6c1619d251e3f6a6385a1aaced041bdc0e50f40aaad/lightyear_networkapi/resizefit_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fd29szjachogqwa.cloudfront.net%2Fimages%2Fuser-uploaded%2Fscreenshot-2026-09-14-at-93634-am_0462.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==\" alt=\"Tech stocks took a leg down on Monday after agreement from AI's leaders over the need to slow development.\" height=\"522\" width=\"960\"></a></p></div> <figcaption>Tech stocks took a leg down on Monday after agreement from AI's leaders over the need to slow development. · Yahoo Finance AlphaSpace</figcaption> </figure>        <p>Tech stocks (XLK) declined more than 2% as chip heavyweight (NVDA) led the semiconductor complex lower.</p>        <p>The move comes after AI titans at Anthropic (ANTH.PVT) and OpenAI (OPAI.PVT) have sounded the alarm on the risks to humanity of artificial intelligence.</p>        <p>Here are some other notable stocks that Yahoo Finance readers are viewing this morning: AMD (AMD), Sandisk (SNDK), and Nebius Group (SKWS).</p>        <p>Click here for the latest stock market news and in-depth analysis, including events that move stocks</p>       </div> <span> </span> </article></div>"}